<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>50cc Scooter Daily Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The 50cc scooter rents at a verified 200,000 VND per day in Hanoi, the smallest engine class in the fleet. This guide plans the daily rental around that single published number, and it is deliberately built on one number: the daily rate is the only verified 50cc figure, so every longer period in this article points to the desk rather than to an estimate.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price, what a 50cc scooter is as a machine, day-by-day budget planning, how the daily rate compares across the fleet, and the deposit, gear and licensing questions that matter most on a 50cc. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
